# text = The British judicial authorities (as confirmed yesterday by the Foreign Minister Alfano), accept to start the European investigation, arranged in October by the Prosecutor’s Office of Rome and to have Abdelrahman formally heard on the circumstances relative to the research carried out by Giulio in Egypt, how it was carried out, the use that was made of the 10 reports that were a partial result of that research and that the same Giulio had given to Abdelrahman in January 2016, two weeks before being kidnapped by the Egyptian security guards.
